 agents interpret tool failures and self-correct their workflow, rather than simply stopping?","readTimeInMinutes":1,"views":0,"author":{"__typename":"User","name":"Abstract Algorithms","profilePicture":"https://cdn.hashnode.com/res/hashnode/image/upload/v1770487824632/88a54ce1-0b80-4d20-baf4-1da06ccf4c7a.jpeg"},"coverImage":{"__typename":"CoverImage","url":"https://mrulwawsc0gz5zy6.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/articles/beyond-observation-agentic-error-recovery-generated-w640.webp"},"tags":[{"__typename":"Tag","id":"ai-agents","name":"AI Agents","slug":"ai-agents"},{"__typename":"Tag","id":"fault-tolerance","name":"Fault Tolerance","slug":"fault-tolerance"},{"__typename":"Tag","id":"autonomous-systems","name":"Autonomous Systems","slug":"autonomous-systems"},{"__typename":"Tag","id":"robust-ai","name":"Robust AI","slug":"robust-ai"},{"__typename":"Tag","id":"ai-llm-agents","name":"ai-llm-agents","slug":"ai-llm-agents"}],"series":null},{"__typename":"Post","id":"optimizing-llm-inference-with-quantization","title":"Optimizing LLM Inference with Quantization","subtitle":"LLM inference optimization is crucial for edge AI.","url":"https://abstractalgorithms.dev/optimizing-llm-inference-with-quantization","publishedAt":"2026-07-19T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-26T19:31:20.302Z","slug":"optimizing-llm-inference-with-quantization","brief":"LLM inference optimization is crucial for edge AI.","readTimeInMinutes":2,"views":0,"author":{"__typename":"User","name":"Abstract Algorithms","profilePicture":"https://cdn.hashnode.com/res/hashnode/image/upload/v1770487824632/88a54ce1-0b80-4d20-baf4-1da06ccf4c7a.jpeg"},"coverImage":{"__typename":"CoverImage","url":"/assets/blog/post-fallback.svg"},"tags":[{"__typename":"Tag","id":"edge-ai","name":"Edge AI","slug":"edge-ai"},{"__typename":"Tag","id":"model-optimization","name":"Model Optimization","slug":"model-optimization"},{"__typename":"Tag","id":"quantization","name":"Quantization","slug":"quantization"},{"__typename":"Tag","